#
# Prezto options.
#
# Carried forward from the 2022 dotfiles repo with two changes, both noted
# inline: the `ssh` module is gone, and the editor key bindings are now pure vi.
#

#
# General
#

# Set case-sensitivity for completion, history lookup, etc.
zstyle ':prezto:*:*' case-sensitive 'no'

# Color output (auto set to 'no' on dumb terminals).
zstyle ':prezto:*:*' color 'yes'

#
# Modules
#
# Order matters. Notes on specific entries:
#
#   homebrew    Still maintained upstream despite occasional claims otherwise.
#               Runs `brew shellenv` with caching and sets FPATH, which is why
#               .zshrc.d/10-homebrew.zsh only has to set one variable.
#
#   osx         Also still current upstream — it was never renamed to `macos`.
#               Provides cdf/pushdf and friends. Not to be confused with the
#               oh-my-zsh `macos` plugin loaded via zplug in .zshrc; they
#               provide different things.
#
#   completion  Runs compinit. Nothing else should.
#
#   autosuggestions, syntax-highlighting
#               Loaded here and ONLY here. Do not also add the standalone
#               zsh-autosuggestions / zsh-syntax-highlighting plugins via
#               zplug — the widgets get bound twice.
#
# Removed from the 2022 list:
#
#   ssh         Was configured to load 'personal' and 'work' identities with
#               agent forwarding. Superseded by the Bitwarden SSH agent, which
#               is wired up in .zshrc.d/95-bitwarden.zsh. Re-enabling this
#               would start a second agent competing for SSH_AUTH_SOCK.
#
zstyle ':prezto:load' pmodule \
  'environment' \
  'terminal' \
  'editor' \
  'history' \
  'directory' \
  'spectrum' \
  'utility' \
  'completion' \
  'autosuggestions' \
  'archive' \
  'osx' \
  'syntax-highlighting' \
  'history-substring-search' \
  'homebrew' \
  'command-not-found'

#
# Editor
#

# Pure vi bindings.
#
# The 2022 setup set this to 'vi' and then had key-bindings.zsh run `bindkey -v`
# a second time before overriding ^a, ^e and ^r back to emacs behavior — a vi
# mode with emacs muscle memory bolted on, fighting itself. Now it is vi, set
# once, here. ^r history search is provided by the history-substring-search
# module instead of a manual bindkey.
zstyle ':prezto:module:editor' key-bindings 'vi'

# Auto convert .... to ../..
zstyle ':prezto:module:editor' dot-expansion 'yes'

#
# Syntax Highlighting
#

zstyle ':prezto:module:syntax-highlighting' highlighters \
  'main' \
  'brackets' \
  'pattern' \
  'cursor' \
  'root'

#
# Terminal
#

# Auto set the tab and window titles.
zstyle ':prezto:module:terminal' auto-title 'yes'

#
# Autosuggestions
#

zstyle ':prezto:module:autosuggestions' color 'yes'
